@api = http://localhost:5112

### Registrar solicitud
POST {{api}}/api/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalReference": "OP-1001",
  "customerId": "CUST-01",
  "serviceCode": "INSTALL",
  "description": "Instalación de equipo"
}

### Mismo externalReference -> 409
POST {{api}}/api/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalReference": "OP-1001",
  "customerId": "CUST-01",
  "serviceCode": "INSTALL",
  "description": "Reintento del usuario"
}

### Campos vacíos -> 400
POST {{api}}/api/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{ "externalReference": "", "customerId": "", "serviceCode": "", "description": "" }

### Listar todas
GET {{api}}/api/requests

### Filtrar por estado
GET {{api}}/api/requests?status=Pending

### Estado inválido -> 400
GET {{api}}/api/requests?status=Foo
